ed by Randle Paul Bennett and painted by Dongjin Choi, this figure embodies the legendary Ghost of Sparta. Showcase these officially licensed products from PlayStation on your shelf in an open box display next to your PS5 console. These action figures are striking PlayStation 5 accessories that inspire & elevate the gaming experience. Immerse yourself in the expansive universe of PlayStation 5 games with other collectible action figures from The Last of Us PS5, Horizon Forbidden West PS5 or, for enthusiasts of PS4 games like Ghost of Tsushima PlayStation 4. These high-end figurines and collectibles go way beyond your run of the mill boy toys or superhero toys (each sold separately). Kratos captivates fans ages 17 and up.\", \"about_author\": null, \"availability\": \"In Stock\", \"reviews_count\": 1436, \"specifications\": {\"ASIN\": \"B0CT8M17JV\", \"Item Weight\": \"7 ounces\", \"Manufacturer\": \"Spin Master\", \"Release date\": \"September 1, 2024\", \"Customer Reviews\": \"4.6 4.6 out of 5 stars (1,436) 4.6 out of 5 stars\", \"Best Sellers Rank\": \"#3,565 in Toys & Games (See Top 100 in Toys & Games) #80 in Action Figures\", \"Item model number\": \"6068730\", \"Product Dimensions\": \"2.8 x 1.54 x 6.34 inches\", \"Manufacturer recommended age\": \"17 years and up\"}, \"feature_bullets\": [{\"label\": \"PREMIUM 6-INCH KRATOS FIGURE\", \"value\": \"Unleash the fury of the Gods with this meticulously crafted Kratos figure, featuring 129 unique finishes that captures his faded white skin and rugged survival armor\"}, {\"label\": \"31 POINTS OF ARTICULATION\", \"value\": \"Pose the Ghost of Sparta in intense battle stances with 31 points of articulation. Every joint is designed for dynamic poses to recreate epic moments from the PS5 games\"}, {\"label\": \"5 ACCESSORIES FOR BATTLE\", \"value\": \"Kratos comes prepared with 5 essential accessories, including his Leviathan Axe, Guardian Shield, Gauntlet and 2 extra handsets, ready for any challenge\"}, {\"label\": \"OPEN DISPLAY BOX\", \"value\": \"Showcase Kratos and additional PlayStation action figures (sold separately) like from The Last of Us and Horizon Forbidden West in this box design, an official licensed product of PlayStation\"}, {\"label\": \"TOYS & GAMES FOR ALL\", \"value\": \"Presented by Spin Master, the creators of kids toys for boys & toys for girls who love collectibles, toy figures & playsets. Ideal holiday gift, or birthday gifts for all ages\"}, {\"label\": \"Includes\", \"value\": \"1 Figure, 5 Accessories\"}], \"product_details\": {\"ASIN\": \"B0CT8M17JV\", \"Item Weight\": \"7 ounces\", \"Manufacturer\": \"Spin Master\", \"Release date\": \"September 1, 2024\", \"Customer Reviews\": \"4.6 4.6 out of 5 stars (1,436) 4.6 out of 5 stars\", \"Best Sellers Rank\": \"#3,565 in Toys & Games ( See Top 100 in Toys & Games ) #80 in Action Figures\", \"Item model number\": \"6068730\", \"Product Dimensions\": \"2.8 x 1.54 x 6.34 inches\", \"Manufacturer recommended age\": \"17 years and up\"}, \"shipping_details\": {\"raw\": \"Delivery Monday, January 5 . Order within 11 hrs 11 mins\"}, \"detected_category\": \"amazon\", \"technical_details\": null, \"important_information\": {}}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-06 11:08:22','2025-12-06 11:08:22'),(4,3,'https://www.amazon.com/Minimalist-Pigmentation-Anti-pigmentation-Hyaluronic-Blemishes/dp/B08GGDRRQ8/?_encoding=UTF8&ref_=pd_hp_d_btf_ci_mcx_mr_ca_id_hp_d','B08GGDRRQ8','Minimalist Brightening and Anti Pigmentation Serum | Removes Acne Marks, Dark Spots & Blemishes | 2% Alpha Arbutin | Contains 4-n-Butylresorcinol(23x More Potent than Kojic Acid) | 1 Fl Oz/30 ml',NULL,'USD',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"rating\": null, \"description\": \"Amazon.com: Minimalist Brightening and Anti Pigmentation Serum | Removes Acne Marks, Dark Spots & Blemishes | 2% Alpha Arbutin | Contains 4-n-Butylresorcinol(23x More Potent than Kojic Acid) | 1 Fl Oz/30 ml : Beauty & Personal Care\", \"about_author\": null, \"availability\": null, \"reviews_count\": null, \"specifications\": {\"Scent\": \"Fragrance Free\", \"Use for\": \"Face\", \"Skin Type\": \"All, Combination, Dry, Oily, Sensitive\", \"Product Benefits\": \"Anti Pigmentation, Blemishes Treatment, Brightening, Even Toning, Glow, Reduce Hyperpigmentation\", \"Special Ingredients\": \"Alpha Arbutin\"}, \"feature_bullets\": [{\"label\": \"[ LIGHTWEIGHT ANTI PIGMENTATION SERUM ]\", \"value\": \"Alpha Arbutin added in this de pigmentation serum is one of the advanced skin lightening ingredient that is clinically proven to reduce hyperpigmentation & blemishes.This serum is lighter than traditional pigmentation removal creams thus absorbs quickly leaving no sticky residue. It is safe to be used daily as an anti-pigmentation serum.\"}, {\"label\": \"[ REDUCES TANNING & DARK SPOTS ]\", \"value\": \"Reduces dark spots, acne marks (or pimple marks), resulting in even skin tone. Alpha Arbutin added in this serum by DSM is proven to reduce tanning after UV exposure. A regular use of this serum can help in reducing skin tan, dark spots & photo damage along with broad spectrum sunscreen.\"}, {\"label\": \"[ EFFECTIVE & SAFE De-PIGMENTATION SERUM ]\", \"value\": \"It is one of safest and effective skin lightening active compared to other actives such as Kojic Acid used in traditional pigmentation removal cream.. It inhibits melanin production without causing cell cytotoxicity thus is safe to be used as anti-pigmentation daily serum for longer durations unlike other skin lightening or brightening ingredients.\"}, {\"label\": \"[ CLEAN & TRANSPARENT BEAUTY ]\", \"value\": \"This serum is (i) Fragrance-free (ii) Silicones-free (iii) Sulfates-free (iv) Parabens-free (v) Essential Oils-free and (vi) Dyes-free. Also, it is non-comedogenic, oil-free, and hypoallergenic. Formulated at pH 4.7 - 5.2 with key ingredient sourced from leading global supplier Royal DSM, Netherlands.\"}, {\"label\": \"[ FOR ALL SKIN TYPES ]\", \"value\": \"Alpha Arbutin is suitable for all skin types